@startuml
!theme plain

<style>
title {
  FontSize 20
  FontColor #333333
}
node {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #666666
}
frame {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #F57F17
}
component {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontColor #1A237E
    roundCorner 15
    shadowing true
}
</style>

title Fase 1: Escalamiento Vertical

actor "Usuario" as User

node "Host (Servidor Potenciado)" {
  note top: Aumento de recursos (CPU/RAM)
  frame "Docker Compose" {
    component "NGINX\n(Proxy Inverso)" as Nginx
    
    package "Servicios de Aplicación" {
      component "Backend\n(Ruby on Rails API)" as Backend
      component "Frontend\n(Expo for Web)" as Frontend
    }

    database "MySQL" as DB
    database "Redis" as Redis
    
    folder "Storage Local" as Storage
  }
}

User --> Nginx
Nginx --> Frontend
Frontend -> Nginx
Nginx --> Backend

Backend <--> DB
Backend <--> Storage
Backend <--> Redis : Cache y Sesiones

note right of Backend
  **Mayor Concurrencia**
  - Workers aumentados para usar
    nuevos cores de CPU.
  - Capacidad total = workers * threads
end note

note bottom of Redis
  **Introducción de Redis**
  - Aliviar carga sobre la base de datos.
  - Gestionar caché de la aplicación.
end note

@enduml